  <name>Steam Audio Isolator</name>
  <summary>Route game audio into Steam recording on Linux (PipeWire)</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Steam Audio Isolator discovers PipeWire playback streams and creates direct links
    to Steam&apos;s game-recording input so captures exclude browser and desktop audio.</p>
    <p>Requires PipeWire and Steam with game recording enabled on the host.</p>
  </description>
